      "content": "…; collection Franz Gawet (1762/65-1847), Vienna (L. 1070); …; collection Carl L. Wiesböck (1811-74), Vienna (L. 2576); …; collection Graf Samuel von Festetits (1806-62), Vienna (L. 926), 1846;{According to an inscription on the drawing.} …; collection Freiherr Philipp Draexler von Carin (1794-1874), Vienna;{According to L. 926.} …; collection Josef Carl Ritter von Klinkosch (1822-88), Vienna, 1872;{According to L. 926 and an inscription on the drawing.} his sale, Vienna (C.J. Wawra), 15 April 1889 <em>sqq.</em>, no. 710 (‘Urias überreicht Davids Brief an Joab. […] Federzeichnung, mit Sepia lavirt’), 250 Austrian Schillings, to Maximilian Todesco (1813-1890), Vienna;{Copy RKD.} his sale, Vienna (H.O. Miethke & A. Einsle), 15 (18) February 1892 <em>sqq.</em>, no. 520 (‘Urias überreicht Davids Brief an Joab. […] Federzeichnung, mit Sepia lavirt’), fl. 100, to A. Einsle;{Copy RKD.} …; purchased from Josef Vincenc Novàk (1842-1918), Prague (L. 1949), by Dr Cornelis Hofstede de Groot (1863-1930), 1904;{Hofstede de Groot notes, KB.} by whom donated to the museum, 1906, but kept in usufruct; transferred to the museum (L. 2228), 1930",
